My second project in my first year of furniture design school, we where all asked to make a "seating element".

&nbsp;

I chose to make a hanging sofa bed idea.



&nbsp;

Having drawn out a proportionally correct shape, i got to work testing and figuring out how to make this strong enough.

https://youtu.be/l8JW8NCgx3o

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

In my first year, I decided to set out to make a walking stick, with lighting built in.

While I never quite got round to finishing the electronics, I got quite close.



&nbsp;

I set myself the challenge of drawing a faceted jewel. And then set about ways of trying to fabricate.&nbsp;

I used 3D printing, and paper folding techniques.&nbsp;&nbsp;
